msgid ""
"You have unsaved changes on individual editable fields. If you run an "
"action, your unsaved changes will be lost."
msgstr ""
"Ou gen chanjman ki pa sove nan chan ki ka modifye yo. Si ou lanse yon "
"aksyon, chanjman ou pa sove yo ap pèdi."

msgid ""
"You have selected an action, but you haven’t saved your changes to "
"individual fields yet. Please click OK to save. You’ll need to re-run the "
"action."
msgstr ""
"Ou chwazi yon aksyon, men ou poko sove chanjman ou nan chan yo. Tanpri klike "
"OK pou sove yo. W ap bezwen relanse aksyon an."

msgid ""
"You have selected an action, and you haven’t made any changes on individual "
"fields. You’re probably looking for the Run button rather than the Save "
"button."
msgstr ""

